    * `Bdf\Prime\Connection\Factory\ConnectionFactory`
    * `Bdf\Prime\Connection\Factory\MasterSlaveConnectionFactory`
    * `Bdf\Prime\Connection\Factory\ShardingConnectionFactory`
    * `Bdf\Prime\Console\CacheCommand`
